   <media:description>Experience the latest Punjabi anthem, Canadian Dream, by the powerhouse duo Chani Nattan and Inderpal Moga. This isn't just a song; it’s a tribute to the hustle, the grit, and the self-made journey of every dreamer building their life from the ground up.
Through powerful lyrics and a heavy beat, the song captures the essence of hard work and the pride of turning struggle into success. Whether you're cruising through the city or hitting the gym, &quot;Canadian Dream&quot; is the motivation you need.

